COMPILATION OF: E52G

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52G

   1 a 0000 E52G:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] FORMAL SHADOW -- THE LOAN2 CURRENT_YEAR SHAPE:
   4 a 0006      outer i fixed dec(4,2) with i = 3; q takes formal i declared
   5 a 0006      fixed dec(9,2) and stores the LITERAL 3 into it; main calls
   6 a 0006      q(i). The literal-to-formal DEC store itself compiles on MINE
   7 a 0006      today without shadowing (hop-1 scratch S2 rc=0); this row adds
   8 a 0006      the shadow, which my flat map refuses. Lexical typing predicts
   9 a 0006      the inner cell 3 B and the formal store cell 5 B (pool 8); the
  10 a 0006      copy-in of a dec(4,2) actual into a dec(9,2) formal is the
  11 a 0006      [C131] route. */
  12 c 0006   dcl i fixed dec(4,2);
  13 c 0006   i = 3;
  14 c 0016   call q(i);
  15 c 002C   q: procedure(i);
  16 e 002C      dcl i fixed dec(9,2);
  17 e 0036      i = 3;
  18 c 0047      end q;
  19 a 0047 end E52G;

CODE SIZE = 004A
DATA AREA = 0014
FREE SYMS = 387C
END  COMPILATION
